  "ruleText": "Gen 102.01 “ABGC” means “ABGC” as defined in RSA 326-K:1, I, namely the “American Board of Genetic Counseling, its equivalent, or successor.”\n\nSource. #10650, eff 8-6-14; ss by #14514, eff 3-1-26",
